          "text": "Scleral Lenses for Complex Needs",
          "html": "Scleral Lenses for Complex Needs",
          "id": "WXjR4ieUFG",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>If you’ve struggled with contact lenses in the past, or your eyes always feel dry, irritated, or uncomfortable, you’re not out of options. Scleral lenses are designed for people who need something more customized. Our Pine Beach eye doctors use these specialty lenses to help patients see clearly and feel comfortable again, even when other solutions haven’t worked.</p>",
          "id": "0YLOP3yMnR",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
