      "nodes": [
        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What Are Scleral Lenses?",
          "html": "What Are Scleral Lenses?",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "9RpCcvHSRM",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Scleral lenses are larger than standard contact lenses and rest on the white part of your eye instead of directly on the cornea. This creates a smooth, stable surface for clear vision while holding a layer of moisture between the lens and your eye. The result is improved comfort and clarity, especially for people with sensitive or dry eyes.</p>",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "Yi6EVaKtAS",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
