      "nodes": [
        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "How Scleral Lenses Improve Comfort",
          "html": "How Scleral Lenses Improve Comfort",
          "id": "UGszNKKYC6",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Because scleral lenses don’t sit directly on the most sensitive part of your eye, they’re often much more comfortable than traditional contacts.</p><p>The fluid layer they create helps keep your eyes hydrated throughout the day, reducing irritation and dryness. For many patients, it’s the first time contact lenses have truly felt comfortable.</p>",
          "id": "8Fardk6IJG",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
