          "id": "yUm0C6U3AB",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Scleral lenses are often recommended for patients who:</p><ul><li>Have chronic dry eye or irritation</li><li>Struggle to wear standard contact lenses</li><li>Have sensitive eyes</li><li>Need more advanced vision correction</li><li>Keratoconus</li></ul>",
