        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Getting Started with Scleral Lenses",
          "html": "Getting Started with Scleral Lenses",
          "id": "nG08V5Ge5d",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>We start with a detailed <a href=\"/eye-care-services/comprehensive-eye-exams/\">eye exam</a> and specialized measurements to design lenses that fit your eyes. You’ll try them on in the office so we can make sure they feel right and give you a clear vision.</p><p>We’ll also walk you through how to use and care for them, step by step. It may take a short adjustment period, but we’ll be here to guide you.</p>",
          "id": "uWeVzElJTT",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
